"""
DownloadWorker — 后台视频下载线程
封装现有 backend/ 的下载模块，通过 Qt 信号汇报进度
【开发状态：已完成】
"""

from PyQt6.QtCore import pyqtSignal

from app.workers.base import BaseWorker
from app.download.url_router import classify_url, UrlType
from app.settings import DOWNLOADS_DIR


class DownloadWorker(BaseWorker):
    """后台视频解析 + 下载"""

    info_parsed = pyqtSignal(dict)           # 视频信息
    download_progress = pyqtSignal(int, int)  # current_bytes, total_bytes
    download_complete = pyqtSignal(dict)      # {filepath, filename, title, ext}

    def __init__(self, url: str, format_id: str = "", download_mode: str = "video", parent=None):
        super().__init__(parent)
        self.url = url
        self.format_id = format_id
        self.download_mode = download_mode  # "video" or "audio" (仅抖音)

    def run(self):
        try:
            self.message.emit("正在识别平台...")
            url_type = classify_url(self.url)

            if url_type == UrlType.DOUYIN:
                self._douyin_flow()
            elif url_type == UrlType.KUAISHOU:
                self._kuaishou_flow()
            else:
                self._generic_flow()

            self.finished.emit()
        except Exception as e:
            self.error.emit(str(e))

    # ------------------------------------------------------------------
    def _douyin_flow(self):
        from douyin import DouyinParser
        parser = DouyinParser(download_dir=str(DOWNLOADS_DIR))
        self.message.emit("正在解析抖音视频...")
        info = parser.parse(self.url)
        self.info_parsed.emit(info)
        if self._cancelled:
            return
        self.message.emit("正在下载抖音视频...")
        self.progress.emit(10)
        result = parser.download(self.url, mode=self.download_mode)
        self.progress.emit(100)
        self.download_complete.emit(result)

    def _kuaishou_flow(self):
        from kuaishou import KuaishouParser
        parser = KuaishouParser(download_dir=str(DOWNLOADS_DIR))
        self.message.emit("正在解析快手视频...")
        info = parser.parse(self.url)
        self.info_parsed.emit(info)
        if self._cancelled:
            return
        self.message.emit("正在下载快手视频...")
        self.progress.emit(10)
        result = parser.download(self.url, mode=self.download_mode)
        self.progress.emit(100)
        self.download_complete.emit(result)

    def _generic_flow(self):
        from downloader import VideoDownloader
        dl = VideoDownloader()
        self.message.emit("正在解析视频信息...")
        info = dl.parse_video(self.url)
        self.info_parsed.emit(info)
        if self._cancelled:
            return
        if not self.format_id:
            # 只解析，不下载
            self.progress.emit(100)
            return
        self.message.emit("正在下载视频...")
        self.progress.emit(10)
        result = dl.download_video(self.url, self.format_id)
        self.progress.emit(100)
        self.download_complete.emit(result)
